{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/extras/SynopsisdAnimated_low.gif?t=1736782610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The I.S.A recorded mysterious changes in Venus's climate. After failing to colonize Mars, it may be humanity\u2019s best hope of escaping Earth. However, all probes have vanished, and now you volunteered for a solo mission to explore the planet\u2019s dark secrets. For mankind, it\u2019s Venus or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VENUS OR DIE is a short atmospheric horror game from the multi-award-winning Blue Desert Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/extras/GameplayGif5.gif?t=1736782610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the shadows of Venus in a six-wheeled exploration vehicle on a solo mission to investigate why the planet's climate is changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/extras/VenusFlyRotation.gif?t=1736782610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect samples to unpack the mystery and avoid the pitfalls of the planet's dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/extras/FeaturesAnimated_Low.gif?t=1736782610\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Venus featuring actual satellite terrain data.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicular platforming and exploration of a lonely and unforgiving planet </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in an atmospheric and claustrophobic environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful AA Visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short 1 - 2 Hour horror experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/extras/gameplaygif7.gif?t=1736782610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273040?t=1736782610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1736782610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/2850cc57f5e7b657509d5a57daede54940986732/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736782610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/2850cc57f5e7b657509d5a57daede54940986732/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736782610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273040/extras/SynopsisdAnimated_low.gif?t=1736782610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The I.S.A recorded mysterious changes in Venus's climate. After failing to colonize Mars, it may be humanity\u2019s best hope of escaping Earth. However, all probes have vanished, and now you volunteered for a solo mission to explore the planet\u2019s dark secrets. For mankind, it\u2019s Venus or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VENUS OR DIE is a short atmospheric horror game from the multi-award-winning Blue Desert Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a